# Pipeline test: one opening, three choices, one of which leads to a second exchange.
# Each choice changes GameState differently. tests/smoke_test.gd walks one branch.

~ start
Sam: Hi, I'm Sam. The client just moved the deadline up by a week.
Sam: What should we do?
- Cut scope and keep the new date.
	do GameState.xp += 10
	Sam: Fewer features, same date. Bold.
- Hire a contractor to go faster.
	do GameState.money -= 40
	do GameState.xp += 5
	Sam: That will eat into the budget.
- Ask the client why the date moved.
	do GameState.xp += 20
	Sam: Good call. The date is soft if they see progress every week.
	Sam: Shall I set up weekly demos?
	- Yes, set them up.
		do GameState.money += 30
		Sam: Done. The client is happy.
	- Not yet.
		Sam: Okay. Let me know.
Sam: Talk later!
=> END
